{{!
    @template enrol_apply/instance_summary

    The one-line summary at the top of a saved instance's settings form: whether it accepts
    applications, the places taken of the limit, and what a group enrolment key does. Each fact is
    a language string filled with numbers and dates, in its plain spelling.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * label string - the name of the summary, for assistive technology
    * facts array - one object per fact, in reading order:
      * first boolean - whether it is the first, which takes no separator before it
      * text string - the fact

    Example context (json):
    {
        "label": "Summary of this method",
        "facts": [
            {"first": true, "text": "Accepting applications until Friday, 4 December 2026, 6:00 PM"},
            {"first": false, "text": "4 of 30 places taken"},
            {"first": false, "text": "Group enrolment keys are not used"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="alert alert-info enrol_apply-summary" role="note" aria-label="{{label}}">
    {{#facts}}{{^first}}<span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span>{{/first}}<span>{{text}}</span>{{/facts}}
</div>
